# HPAC safety-report — skills and agents.
#
# Skills are managed declaratively so every contributor and agent gets the same
# setup from `skillfile install`. Installed copies land in .claude/ and are
# gitignored; Skillfile.lock reproduces upstream sources exactly.
#
# Search before authoring: `skillfile search "<topic>"`. Prefer maintained
# upstream guidance. Keep local skills for HPAC-specific knowledge and
# repository-specific contracts. AGENTS.md always wins on conflict.
#
# Docs: https://github.com/eljulians/skillfile

# install  <platform>  <scope>
install  claude-code  local

# --- Agents ---
# github  agent  [name]  <owner/repo[@ref]>  <path-or-dir>  [ref]

local  agent  agents/anonymization-auditor.md

# --- Skills ---
# github  skill  [name]  <owner/repo[@ref]>  <path-or-dir>  [ref]

# General documentation and ADR practice; local delivery rules are stricter.
github  skill  addyosmani/agent-skills  skills/documentation-and-adrs

# How to find and invoke what is installed.
github  skill  addyosmani/agent-skills  skills/using-agent-skills

# Domain-driven design, .NET flavoured: aggregates, value objects, ports.
github  skill  codewithmukesh/dotnet-claude-kit  skills/ddd

github  skill  github/awesome-copilot  skills/csharp-async
github  skill  github/awesome-copilot  skills/csharp-xunit
github  skill  github/awesome-copilot  skills/dotnet-best-practices
github  skill  github/awesome-copilot  skills/dotnet-design-pattern-review

# Red, green, tidy. Write the test before the code.
github  skill  obra/superpowers  skills/test-driven-development

# --- authored in this repo (source of truth lives under skills/ and agents/) ---
# Note: the redaction rules are deliberately NOT a skill. They are runtime
# assets under prompts/, shipped with the worker and sent to the model when a
# report arrives — not instructions for the agent writing this codebase.
# See prompts/README.md.
# Names are explicit: every source file is called SKILL.md, so without a name
# they would all infer the same one and overwrite each other on install.
local  skill  aircraft-classification  skills/aircraft-classification/SKILL.md
local  skill  anonymize-hpac-reports  skills/anonymize-hpac-reports/SKILL.md
local  skill  build-hpac-web-ui  skills/build-hpac-web-ui/SKILL.md
local  skill  clarify-hpac-requirements  skills/clarify-hpac-requirements/SKILL.md
local  skill  deliver-hpac-change  skills/deliver-hpac-change/SKILL.md
local  skill  gang-of-four-patterns  skills/gang-of-four-patterns/SKILL.md
local  skill  handle-hpac-media  skills/handle-hpac-media/SKILL.md
local  skill  hpac-safety-conventions  skills/hpac-safety-conventions/SKILL.md
local  skill  incident-domain-model  skills/incident-domain-model/SKILL.md
local  skill  localize-hpac-app  skills/localize-hpac-app/SKILL.md
local  skill  manage-hpac-infrastructure  skills/manage-hpac-infrastructure/SKILL.md
local  skill  persist-hpac-data  skills/persist-hpac-data/SKILL.md
local  skill  solid-principles  skills/solid-principles/SKILL.md
